  "content": {
    "protected": false,
    "rendered": "<div class=\"xyz-content\"><nav aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\" class=\"shell pt-6\"> <ol class=\"m-0 flex list-none flex-wrap items-center gap-2 p-0 text-[0.8125rem] text-ink-soft\"> <li class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">  <a href=\"/\" class=\"no-underline hover:underline\"> Home </a> </li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"> <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"text-rule\"> / </span> <a href=\"/tax-tips/\" class=\"no-underline hover:underline\"> Resources </a> </li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"> <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"text-rule\"> / </span> <span aria-current=\"page\">Do I need to lodge a tax return?</span> </li> </ol> </nav> <article class=\"shell pt-6\"> <header class=\"max-w-3xl\"> <p class=\"band-eyebrow\">Resources</p> <h1 class=\"text-3xl sm:text-4xl\">Do I need to lodge a tax return?</h1> <!-- The answer, up front. Snippet and AI Overview capture (brief §6.6). --> <p class=\"mt-4 text-[1.125rem] text-ink\">You must lodge if you earned above the tax-free threshold, ran a business, made a capital gain, or the ATO asked you to. You should lodge if any tax was withheld from your pay — that money comes back only if you claim it.</p> <p class=\"mt-4 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-4 gap-y-1 font-mono text-[0.75rem] tabular-nums text-ink-soft\"> <span>Updated 21 August 2026</span> <span>Current for 2025-26, 2026-27</span> </p> </header> <div class=\"prose-statement mt-10\">  <p>Two different questions get asked here, and they have different answers. “Must I?” is about obligation. “Should I?” is about money. Plenty of people are in the second group without realising it.</p> <h2 id=\"you-must-lodge-if-any-of-these-apply\">You must lodge if any of these apply</h2> <ul> <li>You earned more than <span class=\"font-mono tabular-nums tracking-tight text-ink text-[0.8125rem] font-medium\">$18,200</span> in the year</li> <li>Tax was withheld from any payment to you — including bank interest where you did not give the bank your TFN</li> <li>You ran a business, or received income as a sole trader or contractor</li> <li>You made a capital gain: sold shares, crypto, or an investment property</li> <li>You were an Australian resident and had foreign income</li> <li>You are leaving Australia permanently, or you have a study loan and are heading overseas for more than six months</li> <li>The ATO has sent you a request to lodge</li> </ul> <p>That first threshold is the taxable income one. If you earned</p> <p><span class=\"font-mono tabular-nums tracking-tight text-ink text-[0.8125rem] font-medium\">$20,000</span> you are over it, even if the tax withheld was nil.</p> <h2 id=\"you-should-lodge-if-tax-was-withheld-and-you-earned-under-the-threshold\">You should lodge if tax was withheld and you earned under the threshold</h2> <p>This is the group that quietly leaves money behind. If you worked a few months of the year, or worked casually while studying, your employer withheld tax on each pay as though you would keep earning at that rate all year. You did not.</p> <p>The consequence is that someone who earned <span class=\"font-mono tabular-nums tracking-tight text-ink text-[0.8125rem] font-medium\">$14,000</span> and had <span class=\"font-mono tabular-nums tracking-tight text-ink text-[0.8125rem] font-medium\">$1,800</span> withheld is owed the whole</p> <p><span class=\"font-mono tabular-nums tracking-tight text-return text-[0.8125rem] font-medium\">$1,800</span> back — but only if they lodge. The ATO does not refund it automatically, and there is no reminder.</p> <p>Students, seasonal workers, people who returned from parental leave mid-year and anyone who changed jobs are all common cases. It takes about ten minutes to find out; the calculator below will tell you.</p> <h2 id=\"when-you-can-lodge-a-non-lodgement-advice-instead\">When you can lodge a non-lodgement advice instead</h2> <p>If none of the “must” conditions apply and no tax was withheld, you can submit a non-lodgement advice — sometimes called a return not necessary. It tells the ATO not to expect a return for that year, which stops the reminder letters and stops the year sitting open on your record.</p> <p>You can do it through myGov, or an agent can do it for you. It is not a return and it costs nothing.</p> <p>The reason to bother: an unexplained gap in your lodgement history is the sort of thing that surfaces years later when a bank asks for two years of notices of assessment for a mortgage.</p> <h2 id=\"what-about-a-spouse-or-a-family-member-on-a-pension\">What about a spouse or a family member on a pension?</h2> <p>Pension and allowance recipients often have no lodgement obligation, but there are exceptions — particularly where there is bank interest, a small amount of employment income, or a partner with income. The seniors and pensioners tax offset can also make a return worthwhile where a small amount of tax was withheld.</p> <p>If you are not sure, a non-lodgement advice is the wrong answer to give confidently. Ask.</p> <h2 id=\"if-you-have-not-lodged-for-several-years\">If you have not lodged for several years</h2> <p>Lodge them, and lodge them soon. Three things are true and people generally only know the first:</p> <ol> <li>The failure to lodge penalty accrues at one penalty unit per 28 days late, to a maximum of five — up to about <span class=\"font-mono tabular-nums tracking-tight text-owing text-[0.8125rem] font-medium\">$1,650</span> per return.</li> <li>The ATO treats voluntary catch-up very differently from being chased, and commonly remits penalties entirely for a first offence where a refund is due.</li> <li>Most late individual returns are refunds. The usual outcome of facing it is money coming back, not a bill.</li> </ol> <p>A registered agent can put multiple outstanding years onto a lodgement program and work through them in order. See the <a href=\"/tax-tips/tax-return-deadline/\">tax return deadline</a> page for the dates, or <a href=\"/contact/\">talk to us</a> — it is a routine piece of work and considerably less confronting than people expect.</p> <h2 id=\"work-out-where-you-stand\">Work out where you stand</h2> <p>Enter what you earned and what was withheld. If the number that comes back is positive, you are owed it.</p>  </div> </article> <section class=\"shell mt-16\"> <h2 class=\"text-xl\">Put a number on it</h2> <p class=\"mt-2 max-w-2xl text-[0.9375rem]\"> Estimate your refund by adding the deductions you actually have. Watch the number move as you claim. Free, and it works without an email address. </p> <div class=\"mt-6\"> <div id=\"xyz-island-0\" data-xyz-island=\"RefundCalculator\" data-xyz-props=\"{}\"><div class=\"grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_23rem] lg:gap-12\"><div class=\"min-w-0\"><div class=\"rounded-[4px] border border-[var(--color-rule)] bg-white px-4 sm:px-6\"><div class=\"py-4 border-b border-[var(--color-rule)] last:border-b-0\"><div class=\"flex items-baseline justify-between gap-3\"><label for=\"_r1R_2l_\" class=\"text-sm font-medium text-[var(--color-ink)]\">What do you do for work?</label></div><div class=\"mt-2\"><select id=\"_r1R_2l_\" class=\"w-full rounded-[4px] border border-[var(--color-rule)] bg-white px-3 py-2.5 text-[var(--color-ink)] focus:border-[var(--color-signal)]\"><option value=\"\" selected=\"\">Choose your occupation…</option><option value=\"nurses\">Nurses and midwives</option><option value=\"tradies\">Tradies and construction workers</option><option value=\"teachers\">Teachers and education staff</option><option value=\"sole-traders\">Sole traders and contractors</option><option value=\"doctors\">Doctors and medical practitioners</option><option value=\"students\">Students and casual workers</option><option value=\"property-investors\">Investment property owners</option></select></div><p class=\"mt-1.5 mb-0 text-[0.75rem] text-[var(--color-ink-soft)]\">We use this to ask about the deductions your occupation actually gets — nothing is filled in for you.</p></div><div class=\"py-4 border-b border-[var(--color-rule)] last:border-b-0\"><div class=\"flex items-baseline justify-between gap-3\"><label for=\"_r1R_4l_\" class=\"text-sm font-medium text-[var(--color-ink)]\">Which year are you lodging?</label></div><div class=\"mt-2\"><select id=\"_r1R_4l_\" class=\"w-full rounded-[4px] border border-[var(--color-rule)] bg-white px-3 py-2.5 text-[var(--color-ink)] focus:border-[var(--color-signal)]\"><option value=\"2024-25\">2024–25</option><option value=\"2025-26\" selected=\"\">2025–26 (most people)</option><option value=\"2026-27\">2026–27</option></select></div></div><div class=\"py-4 border-b border-[var(--color-rule)] last:border-b-0\"><div class=\"flex items-baseline justify-between gap-3\"><label for=\"_r1R_6l_\" class=\"text-sm font-medium text-[var(--color-ink)]\">Total income for the year</label></div><div class=\"mt-2\"><div class=\"relative\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"pointer-events-none absolute left-3 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 font-mono text-sm text-[var(--color-ink-soft)]\">$</span><input id=\"_r1R_6l_\" type=\"text\" inputMode=\"decimal\" autoComplete=\"off\" class=\"w-full rounded-[4px] border border-[var(--color-rule)] bg-white px-3 py-2.5 text-[var(--color-ink)] focus:border-[var(--color-signal)] pl-7 text-right\" placeholder=\"0\" value=\"75,000\"/></div></div><p class=\"mt-1.5 mb-0 text-[0.75rem] text-[var(--color-ink-soft)]\">The gross figure from your income statement, before tax.</p></div><div class=\"py-4 border-b border-[var(--color-rule)] last:border-b-0\"><div class=\"flex items-baseline justify-between gap-3\"><label for=\"_r1R_8l_\" class=\"text-sm font-medium text-[var(--color-ink)]\">Tax withheld</label><span class=\"font-mono text-[0.75rem] tabular-nums text-[var(--color-ink-soft)]\">estimated</span></div><div class=\"mt-2\"><div class=\"relative\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"pointer-events-none absolute left-3 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 font-mono text-sm text-[var(--color-ink-soft)]\">$</span><input id=\"_r1R_8l_\" type=\"text\" inputMode=\"decimal\" autoComplete=\"off\" class=\"w-full rounded-[4px] border border-[var(--color-rule)] bg-white px-3 py-2.5 text-[var(--color-ink)] focus:border-[var(--color-signal)] pl-7 text-right\" placeholder=\"0\" value=\"15,675\"/></div></div><p class=\"mt-1.5 mb-0 text-[0.75rem] text-[var(--color-ink-soft)]\">Also on your income statement, usually labelled “Tax withheld”. We have estimated it until you enter the real figure.</p></div><div class=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-4 border-b border-[var(--color-rule)] py-4 last:border-b-0\"><div class=\"max-w-sm\"><label for=\"_r1R_al_\" class=\"text-sm font-medium text-[var(--color-ink)]\">I have a HECS-HELP or study loan</label><p class=\"mt-1 mb-0 text-[0.75rem] text-[var(--color-ink-soft)]\">A compulsory repayment starts at <span class=\"font-mono tabular-nums\">$67,000</span> and comes out of your refund.</p></div><input id=\"_r1R_al_\" type=\"checkbox\" class=\"mt-0.5 h-5 w-5 shrink-0 accent-[var(--color-signal)]\"/></div><div class=\"py-6\"><p class=\"m-0 text-[0.8125rem] text-[var(--color-ink-soft)]\">Pick an occupation above and we’ll ask about the deductions that apply to it. Or<!-- --> <a href=\"/tax-tips/what-can-i-claim/\">read the full list of what you can claim</a>.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"min-w-0 lg:sticky lg:top-6 lg:self-start\"><div class=\"overflow-hidden rounded-[4px] border border-[var(--color-rule)] bg-white\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-3 border-b border-[var(--color-rule)] bg-[var(--color-ink)] px-4 py-3\"><span class=\"font-mono text-[0.6875rem] uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-[var(--color-paper)]\">Your refund</span><span class=\"font-mono text-[0.6875rem] tabular-nums text-[var(--color-paper)]/70\">2025–26</span></div><div class=\"tally-print\"><div data-tally-line=\"gross\" class=\"border-b border-[var(--color-rule)] \"><div class=\"flex items-baseline justify-between gap-4 px-4 py-2.5\"><button type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-left text-[0.8125rem] text-[var(--color-ink-soft)] hover:text-[var(--color-ink)]\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"inline-block text-[0.625rem] text-[var(--color-ink-soft)] transition-transform \">▶</span>Gross income</button><span class=\"shrink-0 text-[0.9375rem] text-[var(--color-ink-soft)]\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"font-mono text-[var(--color-ink-soft)]\"></span><span class=\"font-mono tabular-nums \" aria-hidden=\"true\">$75,000</span></span></div></div><div data-tally-line=\"deductions\" class=\"border-b border-[var(--color-rule)] \"><div class=\"flex items-baseline justify-between gap-4 px-4 py-2.5\"><button type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-left text-[0.8125rem] text-[var(--color-ink-soft)] hover:text-[var(--color-ink)]\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"inline-block text-[0.625rem] text-[var(--color-ink-soft)] transition-transform \">▶</span>Less deductions</button><span class=\"shrink-0 text-[0.9375rem] text-[var(--color-ink-soft)]\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"font-mono text-[var(--color-ink-soft)]\">−</span><span class=\"font-mono tabular-nums \" aria-hidden=\"true\">$0</span></span></div></div><div data-tally-line=\"taxable\" class=\"border-b border-[var(--color-rule)] bg-[var(--color-paper-sunk)]\"><div class=\"flex items-baseline justify-between gap-4 px-4 py-2.5\"><button type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-left text-[0.8125rem] font-semibold text-[var(--color-ink)] hover:text-[var(--color-ink)]\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"inline-block text-[0.625rem] text-[var(--color-ink-soft)] transition-transform \">▶</span>Taxable income</button><span class=\"shrink-0 text-[0.9375rem] font-semibold text-[var(--color-ink)]\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"font-mono text-[var(--color-ink-soft)]\"></span><span class=\"font-mono tabular-nums font-semibold\" aria-hidden=\"true\">$75,000</span></span></div></div><div data-tally-line=\"income-tax\" class=\"border-b border-[var(--color-rule)] \"><div class=\"flex items-baseline justify-between gap-4 px-4 py-2.5\"><button type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-left text-[0.8125rem] text-[var(--color-ink-soft)] hover:text-[var(--color-ink)]\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"inline-block text-[0.625rem] text-[var(--color-ink-soft)] transition-transform \">▶</span>Income tax</button><span class=\"shrink-0 text-[0.9375rem] text-[var(--color-ink-soft)]\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"font-mono text-[var(--color-ink-soft)]\"></span><span class=\"font-mono tabular-nums \" aria-hidden=\"true\">$13,288</span></span></div></div><div data-tally-line=\"medicare\" class=\"border-b border-[var(--color-rule)] \"><div class=\"flex items-baseline justify-between gap-4 px-4 py-2.5\"><button type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-left text-[0.8125rem] text-[var(--color-ink-soft)] hover:text-[var(--color-ink)]\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"inline-block text-[0.625rem] text-[var(--color-ink-soft)] transition-transform \">▶</span>Medicare levy</button><span class=\"shrink-0 text-[0.9375rem] text-[var(--color-ink-soft)]\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"font-mono text-[var(--color-ink-soft)]\"></span><span class=\"font-mono tabular-nums \" aria-hidden=\"true\">$1,500</span></span></div></div><div data-tally-line=\"total-tax\" class=\"border-b border-[var(--color-rule)] bg-[var(--color-paper-sunk)]\"><div class=\"flex items-baseline justify-between gap-4 px-4 py-2.5\"><button type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-left text-[0.8125rem] font-semibold text-[var(--color-ink)] hover:text-[var(--color-ink)]\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"inline-block text-[0.625rem] text-[var(--color-ink-soft)] transition-transform \">▶</span>Total tax</button><span class=\"shrink-0 text-[0.9375rem] font-semibold text-[var(--color-ink)]\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"font-mono text-[var(--color-ink-soft)]\"></span><span class=\"font-mono tabular-nums font-semibold\" aria-hidden=\"true\">$14,788</span></span></div></div><div data-tally-line=\"payg\" class=\"border-b border-[var(--color-rule)] \"><div class=\"flex items-baseline justify-between gap-4 px-4 py-2.5\"><button type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-left text-[0.8125rem] text-[var(--color-ink-soft)] hover:text-[var(--color-ink)]\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"inline-block text-[0.625rem] text-[var(--color-ink-soft)] transition-transform \">▶</span>Less tax already withheld</button><span class=\"shrink-0 text-[0.9375rem] text-[var(--color-ink-soft)]\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"font-mono text-[var(--color-ink-soft)]\">−</span><span class=\"font-mono tabular-nums \" aria-hidden=\"true\">$15,675</span></span></div></div></div><div data-tally-line=\"refund\" class=\"px-4 py-5\"><div class=\"flex items-end justify-between gap-4\"><div><p class=\"m-0 text-[0.8125rem] font-medium text-[var(--color-ink)]\">Estimated refund</p><p class=\"m-0 mt-0.5 max-w-[22rem] text-[0.6875rem] text-[var(--color-ink-soft)]\">What the ATO would pay back on these figures.</p></div><div class=\"flex h-11 shrink-0 items-center\"><span class=\"font-mono tabular-nums text-[1.75rem] font-bold text-[var(--color-return)]\" aria-hidden=\"true\">$887</span></div></div><p class=\"sr-only\" aria-live=\"polite\">Estimated refund<!-- -->:<!-- --> <span class=\"font-mono tabular-nums\">$887</span></p><p class=\"m-0 mt-2 font-mono text-[0.6875rem] tabular-nums text-[var(--color-ink-soft)]\">$15,675 withheld − $14,788 tax</p><div class=\"mt-4\"><div class=\"space-y-3\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://brsadvisory.myassembly.com/login?step=signUp&amp;income=75000&amp;payg=15675&amp;fy=2025-26&amp;refund=887\" class=\"block rounded-[4px] bg-[var(--color-ink)] px-4 py-2.5 text-center text-sm font-semibold text-[var(--color-paper)] no-underline\">Lodge and claim <span class=\"font-mono tabular-nums\">$887</span></a><p class=\"m-0 text-center text-[0.6875rem] text-[var(--color-ink-soft)]\">Individual returns from <span class=\"font-mono tabular-nums\">$99</span>.</p><p class=\"m-0 text-[0.6875rem] leading-relaxed text-[var(--color-ink-soft)]\">An estimate, not tax advice. We never ask for your tax file number on this site.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-testid=\"sticky-result\" class=\"fixed inset-x-0 bottom-0 z-40 border-t border-[var(--color-rule)] bg-white/95 backdrop-blur lg:hidden\"><div class=\"mx-auto flex max-w-[68rem] items-center justify-between gap-3 px-5 py-3\"><div class=\"min-w-0\"><p class=\"m-0 truncate text-[0.6875rem] uppercase tracking-[0.1em] text-[var(--color-ink-soft)]\">Estimated refund</p><p class=\"m-0 font-mono text-lg font-bold tabular-nums text-[var(--color-return)]\">$887</p></div><a href=\"https://brsadvisory.myassembly.com/login?step=signUp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"shrink-0 rounded-[4px] bg-[var(--color-ink)] px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-[var(--color-paper)] no-underline\">Claim it</a></div></div><div class=\"h-20 lg:hidden\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><!--astro:end--></div> </div> <div class=\"mt-6\"> <p class=\"m-0 max-w-2xl text-[0.8125rem] leading-relaxed text-ink-soft\"> This is an estimate, not tax advice. It works from the figures you enter and the ATO rates for the year you selected; your actual assessment is determined by the ATO and may differ. We never ask for your tax file number on this site. </p> </div> </section><section class=\"shell mt-16\"> <div class=\"card p-6\"> <h2 class=\"text-lg\">Keep going</h2> <p class=\"mt-2 mb-3 max-w-2xl text-[0.9375rem]\"> Every calculator on this site is free and ungated — income tax, refunds, capital gains, HECS-HELP, Medicare and more. </p> <a href=\"/calculators/\" class=\"btn btn-secondary text-sm\">All calculators</a> </div> </section> <section class=\"cta-dark\"> <div class=\"cta-grid\"> <div> <p class=\"band-eyebrow\">Ready to lodge it?</p> <h2>A registered agent prepares it, checks it, and lodges it.</h2> <p>Most refunds land within two weeks of assessment. The fee is fixed and quoted before we start — nothing is charged until you approve the finished return.</p> <div class=\"cta-actions\"> <a href=\"https://brsadvisory.myassembly.com/login?step=signUp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"btn\">Start your return</a> <a href=\"/services/pricing/\" class=\"btn btn-secondary\">See pricing</a> </div> </div> <div class=\"cta-spec\"> <div class=\"cta-spec-row\"><span>Individual returns from</span><b>$99</b></div> <div class=\"cta-spec-row\"><span>Registered tax agent</span><b>26233684</b></div> <div class=\"cta-spec-row\"><span>Fixed fee, quoted up front</span><i>included</i></div> <div class=\"cta-spec-row\"><span>Fee taken from your refund</span><b>$44</b></div> </div> </div> </section></div><script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/brseeger-cloud/xyz-accounting-assets@main/islands/RefundCalculator.js\" defer></script>"
